@startuml
title Overall Architecture - Node Diagram

' Nodes
node "Note 20\n(openclaw Gateway, Local Server)" as Note20
cloud "Gemini API\n(AI Service)" as Gemini
cloud "Brave Search\n(Web Search API)" as Brave
cloud "Google Chat\n(Channel - User Input)" as GoogleChat
cloud "Notion API\n(Storage)" as Notion

' Relationships
Note20 --> Gemini : Call AI Features
Note20 --> Brave : Request Internet Search
GoogleChat --> Note20 : Receive User Input
Note20 --> Notion : Save Data (Notion API)

' Additional notes
note right of Note20
  - Install openclaw on Note 20 (mobile phone)
  - AI Processing via Gemini API
  - Web Search via Brave Search
  - Channel Input/Output via Google Chat
  - Data Storage via Notion API
end note

@enduml
